<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span><span id="S2.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">AfriMGSM performance across various LLMs and key multilingual approaches</span>. We report Exact Match scores averaged over the displayed languages. We use the NLLB-600M distilled model as the encoder, and Gemma2-9b-it for MindMerger, MERLIN, and as the base model for QAlign. We use AfriTeVa-v2-Large as the encoder of LangBridge. Note that the released LangBridge source code does not accept NLLB architecture.</figcaption>
</figure>
