<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>AmericasNLI Evaluation</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To assess whether the mapping curriculum generalises beyond the African and European test beds, we evaluate <span id="A5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">MERLIN</span> on <span id="A5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AmericasNLI</span>, a three-way NLI benchmark that targets Aymara, Guarani, and Quechua. For <span id="A5.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">MERLIN</span> and the MindMerger baseline, we follow the same data pipeline as for <span id="A5.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AfriXNLI</span>: 3,000 English premise–hypothesis pairs are sampled from <span id="A5.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">MultiNLI</span>, translated into each target language with <span id="A5.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">NLLB</span> 600m distilled, and used as supervision for Stage I.b, Stage I.c, and Stage II.<span id="footnote4" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">4</span>
            
            
            
            
            
            
            
          No task-specific data from the original <span id="footnote4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">AmericasNLI</span> development set is seen during training.</span></span></span> The non-adapted LLaMAX2-7B-XNLI <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib27" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lu et al., 2024</a>)</cite> serves as the baseline decoder-only model. Results are summarised in Table <a href="#A5.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix E AmericasNLI Evaluation ‣ Merlin: Multi-Stage Curriculum Alignment for Multilingual Encoder and LLM Fusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A5.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A5.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A5.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
